{"4316140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nightfall Berlin", "steam_appid": 4316140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nightfall Berlin <strong>is an occult detective RPG with a focus on exploration, case-solving and our relationship to the places where we live and die, set in the dynamic, seductive and violent history of 90s Berlin.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Vampire the Masquerade: Bloodlines, Deus Ex and Hellblazer, it weaves a tale of drug-fuelled conspiracy and self-actualization, that combines Germanic folklore with neo-noir themes.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set to the backdrop of the dynamic, seductive and violent history of Berlin, it mixes imsim-style exploration with clue-hunting and case-solving detective gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316140/extras/dad24a345c6d5b0f442547b5a9b080d7.poster.avif?t=1780481914\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316140/extras/dad24a345c6d5b0f442547b5a9b080d7.webm?t=1780481914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sim-inspired traversal and level design without combat: use your skills and surroundings to avoid your enemies. Use spells such as telekinesis to influence the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immerse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the dark side of Berlin and its demonic inhabitants in a tale mixing occult history with the modern realities of the city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and combine clues, interview people and take photo for your Evidence Board. Make your decisions based on what you find and discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nightfall Berlin <strong>is an occult detective RPG with a focus on exploration, case-solving and our relationship to the places where we live and die, set in the dynamic, seductive and violent history of 90s Berlin.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Vampire the Masquerade: Bloodlines, Deus Ex and Hellblazer, it weaves a tale of drug-fuelled conspiracy and self-actualization, that combines Germanic folklore with neo-noir themes.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set to the backdrop of the dynamic, seductive and violent history of Berlin, it mixes imsim-style exploration with clue-hunting and case-solving detective gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316140/extras/dad24a345c6d5b0f442547b5a9b080d7.poster.avif?t=1780481914\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316140/extras/dad24a345c6d5b0f442547b5a9b080d7.webm?t=1780481914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sim-inspired traversal and level design without combat: use your skills and surroundings to avoid your enemies. Use spells such as telekinesis to influence the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immerse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the dark side of Berlin and its demonic inhabitants in a tale mixing occult history with the modern realities of the city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and combine clues, interview people and ta